        <div class="card"><h3>Current documents</h3><p>Policies and assessments reflect how the organization operates today.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Organized records</h3><p>Evidence is in one place and can be produced quickly.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Responsible owners</h3><p>Each area has a named person accountable for it.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Policies match practice</h3><p>What the policy says is what staff actually do.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Documented risk management</h3><p>Identified risks have a recorded decision and plan.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Issues closed out</h3><p>Fixes are recorded, with dates, not just carried out.</p></div>
