      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Problem</th><th scope="col">Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Documents exist but are stale</td><td>An outdated risk analysis may not reflect current systems or risks</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Policies do not match operations</td><td>A policy that is not followed can be worse than none</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Risk assessments are incomplete</td><td>Systems, locations, or vendors left out of scope</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Training records cannot be found</td><td>Training that cannot be shown is hard to prove</td></tr>
            <tr><td>BAAs scattered or missing</td><td>No clear record of which vendors are covered</td></tr>
