</section>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="note">We do not have advance knowledge of regulatory audits or investigations, and a readiness review does not mean your organization has been selected for one. Readiness is about being prepared for any review, whether from a regulator, a payer, a partner, or your own leadership.</p>
  </div>
</section>

